## Artefact-1 : Root Cause Analasyis Fundamentals Article 

### Summary 
Root Cause Analysis: Process, Techniques, and Best Practices" defines RCA as a systematic process of uncovering fundamental causes of problems. RCA facilitates continuous improvement and evolves from reactive (after incidents) to proactive (preventing incidents). It categorises RCA into safety-based, production-based, and process-based types (The Business Analyst Job Description, 2025, p. 1).
